#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/bezier_curves.rst:50
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/bezier_curves.rst:66
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/bezier_curves.rst:51
msgid ""
"This effect is used to adjust the color levels similar to the :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/3_point_balance` "
"but with finer control. Although the effect defaults to the RGB channel, it "
"is mostly used with the :term:`Luma` channel. See also the :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves` effect that "
"does the same thing but does not have the curve handles."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt slúži na nastavenie farebných úrovní podobne ako :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/3_point_balance`, "
"ale s väčšou presnosťou. Hoci predvolene operuje na kanáli RGB, väčšinou sa "
"používa s kanálom :term:`Luma`. Pozrite tiež efekt :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves`, ktorý robí "
"to isté, ale nemá rukoväte kriviek."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/bezier_curves.rst:53
msgid ""
"Click anywhere on the graph paper to insert a node. Use the extended handles "
"on the node to adjust the steepness of the curve leading to and leaving the "
"point."
msgstr ""
"Kliknutím kdekoľvek na milimetrový papier vložíte uzol. Pomocou rozšírených "
"rukovätí na uzle nastavíte strmosť krivky vedúcej k bodu a od bodu."

